  "note": "b14 (CRANE KART, Kart's crane robe, in the fight since 10-11) holds a long sword (1.29 m, a tassel on the pommel) in her right hand in her game's battle stance, but boxed with the motion pack's punches: the sword showed only in her game's own clips (skills, intro, win). As Inase (a08_sword) and Kart's b10 (b10_axe): strikes with the sword in her hand. Her stance holds it reversed, the blade up along her forearm; in every swing of her skills she turns it about 160 degrees into a forward grip, so her grip (tools/roe/b14_grip.json, RoeGrips on Wp_01, the sword's own bone) is the one she cuts with in skill_01 (frames 18-48). Candidates: seven pieces of her own three skills (her game has no normal attacks) and every one-handed sword move of Vindictus' Fiona (right hand, forward grip) that Fiona, Inase and b10 do not use yet. Full Vindictus clips (combo windows 2-2.8 s); the picked ones get cut to their swing.",
